Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd, pipewire
Description: HiFiBerry analog input management service
 Manages analog input functionality for HiFiBerry audio systems.
 This service handles analog input configuration and routing by
 connecting ALSA ADC nodes to effect_input.proc using PipeWire.
